  title="Bridged Doors: A No-Charge Modification in Shiloh and Eclipse"
  description="Bridged Doors give a full-height door the look of a drawer stack or a door-and-drawer front, at no charge, in full overlay/frameless, inset, and modern inset. Where to use them, spec limits (doors up to 24″ wide, 700 Edge), and which styles are excluded."
  author="Ben Miller"
  publishedDate="2026-08-11"
